            aOrbiterA = ((aWandererD + RotL64(aCross, 3U)) + 0x5E50D19E76F3A382ULL) + aPhaseCOrbiterAssignSaltA[(((31U - aIndex) + 17U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterH = ((aWandererG + RotL64(aPrevious, 19U)) + RotL64(aCarry, 41U)) + 0x1F563C30AD30F69FULL;
            aOrbiterK = (((aWandererI + RotL64(aIngress, 60U)) + RotL64(aCarry, 57U)) + 0x1289920C0647D55AULL) + aPhaseCOrbiterAssignSaltE[((aIndex + 3U)) & S_SALT1];
